its for players. The beauty element is the infrastructure layer of this game design, and our top priority is to enable players to better enjoy the benefits of infrastructure. Therefore, placing the main scene on a tropical deserted island will make the benefits more natural and abundant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondly, the enjoyment brought by visual aesthetics is dopamine, and the flow brought by survival challenges is endorphins. We expect players who experience this game to receive dual feedback of dopamine and endorphins, providing a different experience from previous interactive games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, any attempt at innovation carries risks. For this work, players who love survival games may feel that the survival elements are not enough, while players who enjoy love games may feel that the love plot is lacking. Creation is a regrettable art. We want to make a live action interactive video game version of 'Famine', but the sandbox world is too budget intensive for live action shooting, and excessive death results are also afraid of giving players a bad experience. Therefore, we have decided to take survival as the main storyline, use item synthesis as the main gameplay, hide the favorability system, and let girls attack the male lead instead of the male lead attacking girls. This is an innovative exploration of interactive video games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, I would like to express my gratitude to all the players who supported this game, to all the staff who participated in its production, especially the field workers who carried the equipment during the hot weather, and to the actresses who persisted in filming barefoot throughout the mountains and fields. Welcome players to follow our official  the future, we will collect everyone's opinions and make unlimited progress with each passing day.</p>",
